msgid "Suggested text for sites that let commenters attach a video. Adjust the retention and contact details to match your site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-privacy.php:63
msgid "When you attach a video to a comment, the video file is uploaded from your browser directly to Mux (Mux, Inc.), a third-party video hosting service, and is stored and streamed from their servers. Mux's handling of that file is governed by their privacy policy."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-privacy.php:64
msgid "This site stores only the identifiers Mux assigns to your video, linked to your comment. Anyone who can view the comment can watch the video. Pages that show a video load the Mux video player from a third-party content delivery network (jsDelivr), which receives your IP address as part of that request."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-privacy.php:65
msgid "Your IP address is used in hashed form for up to one minute to limit how often video uploads can be requested. Videos are deleted from Mux when the comment they belong to is permanently deleted, when a site administrator removes the video, when an upload is abandoned without posting a comment, or when you ask us to erase your personal data."
msgstr ""

